    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListRowDragSource:PoolIndex
    src   "The POOL slot, not the item: a recycled row stands for a different item every few scrolls."
    text  "池槽位，而非项：回收的行每隔几次滚动就代表另一个项。"
    state machine
}

DreamListRowDropTarget {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListRowDropTarget
    src   "The drop target a list puts on its rows.\n\nSame relationship as the source above. What it adds is the ZONE: the base answers \"may this drop\nland here\", and a list also has to say WHERE on the row it landed, which is a question about the\nrow's rect and the pointer -- neither of which the base has any reason to look at."
    text  "列表放在其行上的放置目标。\n\n与上面的源关系相同。它新增的是区域：基类回答“此放置是否可以落在这里”，\n而列表还必须说明它落在行上的哪里，这涉及行的矩形和指针——基类没有任何理由\n去看这两者。"
    state machine
}

DreamListRowDropTarget:HandleDragEnter {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListRowDropTarget:HandleDragEnter
    src   "Bound to this target's OWN enter and leave, so the row never has to be searched for.\n\nThe base's delegates carry only the operation, and the operation cannot say which row fired.\nA search would also have had to guess on leave, where the hovered flag is already down by the\ntime anyone is told -- whereas the target has known its own pool slot since it was made."
    text  "绑定到此目标自身的 enter 和 leave，因此无需再查找该行。\n\n基类的委托只携带操作，而操作无法说明是哪一行触发的。\n查找在 leave 时也只能靠猜，因为等到有人收到通知时，悬停标志已经\n置下——而目标从创建时就已知自己的池槽位。"
    state machine
}

DreamListRowDropTarget:HandleDragOver {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListRowDropTarget:HandleDragOver
    src   "Every frame a drag hovers this row -- the subsystem's Over, forwarded for the same reason the\ntwo edges are. It is what edge scrolling rides: the drag-drop subsystem already ticks the hover\nonce a frame, so the list steps its scroll there instead of keeping a clock of its own."
    text  "拖拽悬停于此行的每一帧——子系统的 Over 被转发，原因与\n两个边缘相同。边缘滚动正是靠它驱动：拖放子系统已经每帧 tick 一次悬停，\n因此列表在那里步进滚动，而不是自己维护一个时钟。"
    state machine
}

DreamListScrolledEvent__DelegateSignature {
