    src   "Insert one object at a source index and rebuild -- UMG's AddItemAt.\n\nThe parallel text goes in at the SAME place, because the two arrays describe the same rows:\ninserting into one alone re-labels every row after the seam."
    text  "在源的指定索引处插入一个对象并重建——即 UMG 的 AddItemAt。\n\n并行文本会插入到同一位置，因为这两个数组描述的是同一批行：\n只向其中一个插入会重新标记接缝之后的所有行。"
    state machine
}

