DreamListViewBase:bAllowDragDrop {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bAllowDragDrop
    src   "Whether a row can be dropped ON -- UMG's bAllowDragDrop.\n\nSeparate from bAllowDragging on purpose, and both directions are useful: a palette a player\ndrags OUT of but never into wants dragging alone, and an equipment list that accepts items\nfrom elsewhere wants dropping alone."
    text  "是否可以将内容放置到行上——即 UMG 的 bAllowDragDrop。\n\n有意与 bAllowDragging 分开，两个方向都有用：一个玩家只从中拖出、从不拖入的\n调色板只需要拖动，而一个接受来自其他位置物品的\n装备列表只需要放置。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bAllowDragging {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bAllowDragging
    src   "Whether a row can be picked UP -- UMG's bAllowDragging.\n\nOff, and off is literal: with this false no row carries a drag behaviour at all, so an existing\nlist gains nothing to subscribe to, nothing to tick and nothing that could change what a press\non a row means. Turning it on adds the behaviour to every pool row, including ones already\nmade."
    text  "行是否可以被拾起——即 UMG 的 bAllowDragging。\n\n默认关闭，而且关闭是字面意义上的：为 false 时，任何行都不会带有拖动行为，因此现有\n列表既没有可订阅的内容，也没有需要 Tick 的内容，更没有任何会改变按下\n某一行含义的内容。开启后会将此行为添加到每个行池中的行，包括已经\n创建的行。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bAllowKeepPreselectedItems {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bAllowKeepPreselectedItems
    src   "Whether a selection made before its item arrived is REMEMBERED -- UMG's\nbAllowKeepPreselectedItems.\n\nReconcileSelection drops indices the source no longer answers to, which is right for a source\nthat shrank and wrong for one that has not been filled yet: a screen that restores \"row 7 was\nselected\" before its data loads would otherwise silently lose it. With this on, a dropped index\nis parked and re-applied the moment the source is long enough to hold it.\n\nOff, one case is still kept: an index asked for while the source is EMPTY waits for the items\n(see SetSelectedIndex), because an empty source is not one that shrank -- it has not arrived."
    text  "是否记住在其项到达之前做出的选择——UMG 的\nbAllowKeepPreselectedItems。\n\nReconcileSelection 会丢弃源不再响应的索引，对于缩小的源这是正确的，\n但对于尚未填充的源则是错误的：某个界面在数据加载前恢复“第 7 行\n已选中”，否则会悄无声息地丢失它。开启后，被丢弃的索引\n会被暂存，并在源足够长、能容纳它时立即重新应用。\n\n关闭时，仍会保留一种情况：在源为空时请求的索引会等待项\n（参见 SetSelectedIndex），因为空源并不是缩小的源——它只是尚未到达。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bAllowOverscroll {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bAllowOverscroll
    src   "Let the rows be pulled past an end and spring back -- UMG's AllowOverscroll."
    text  "允许将行拉过端点并回弹——即 UMG 的 AllowOverscroll。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bAlternatingRowColors {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bAlternatingRowColors
    src   "Every other row wears FDreamListStyle::RowAlternate. Off is the dense list UMG draws.\n\nBlueprintSetter, like every writable knob on this control: nothing in this family re-derives a\ncontrol from a property that moved -- the SynchronizeProperties tax UDreamUIControl documents --\nso a runtime write straight onto the variable used to change the number and leave the list\nexactly as it was, with nothing anywhere saying why."
    text  "每隔一行使用FDreamListStyle::RowAlternate。关闭时就是UMG绘制的紧凑列表。\n\n蓝图设置器（BlueprintSetter），和此控件上的每个可写开关一样：此系列中没有任何\n东西会因属性变动而重新派生控件——UDreamUIControl记载的SynchronizeProperties\n开销正是如此——因此直接对该变量进行运行时写入，过去只会改变数字，却让列表\n保持原样，且没有任何地方说明原因。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bClearScrollVelocityOnSelection {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bClearScrollVelocityOnSelection
    src   "Whether choosing a row also stops a fling -- UMG's bClearScrollVelocityOnSelection.\n\nOff, which is what this control has always done. On, a click or a navigation press kills the\nmomentum, so the row the player picked does not slide out from under the cursor."
    text  "选择行是否也会停止惯性滑动——即 UMG 的 bClearScrollVelocityOnSelection。\n\n关闭，这是此控件一直以来的行为。开启后，单击或导航按键会消除\n动量，因此玩家选中的行不会从光标下方滑走。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bEnableDragEdgeScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bEnableDragEdgeScrolling
    src   "Whether a drag held near the viewport's edge scrolls the list towards that edge -- which UMG's\nlist does not do, and which is what makes a drop onto a row that is off screen possible at all.\n\nWhile a drag this list would accept (bAllowDragDrop, and whatever CanAcceptDrop says) hovers a\nrow within DragEdgeScrollBandSize of the viewport's near or far edge, the list scrolls that way\nat DragEdgeScrollSpeed. It stops the moment the pointer leaves the band, leaves the list, or lets\ngo. The step is taken where the drag-drop subsystem already ticks the hover -- once a frame --\nso nothing extra polls, and a list with no drag over it does no work at all. While it moves the\nlist counts as scrolling, so OnListViewFinishedScrolling is said once, when it stops.\n\nOff by default, because it changes what an existing drop target does: with it on, holding a drag\nover the first or last row that shows moves the rows under the pointer instead of waiting for the\ndrop."
    text  "在视口边缘附近按住拖拽时，列表是否朝该边缘滚动——UMG的\n列表不会这样做，而正是有了这一点，才能把内容拖放到屏幕外的行上。\n\n当这个列表会接受的拖拽（bAllowDragDrop，以及CanAcceptDrop的判断）悬停在\n距视口近端或远端边缘DragEdgeScrollBandSize范围内的一行上时，列表就以\nDragEdgeScrollSpeed朝该方向滚动。指针一离开该区域、离开列表或松开，\n滚动立刻停止。步进发生在拖放子系统本就每帧更新悬停的地方——\n因此没有额外的轮询，而没有拖拽悬停的列表完全不做事。滚动期间\n列表算作正在滚动，所以停止时会触发一次OnListViewFinishedScrolling。\n\n默认关闭，因为它会改变现有放置目标的行为：开启后，把拖拽按在\n当前可见的第一行或最后一行上，会移动指针下方的行，而不是等待\n放置。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bEnableFixedLineOffset {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bEnableFixedLineOffset
    src   "Pin a revealed row at a fixed share of the window instead of merely bringing it inside --\nUMG's bEnableFixedLineOffset.\n\nWhat a cursor-driven menu wants: the highlighted row stays put and the list moves underneath\nit, rather than the row sliding to whichever edge it came in from. Off by default, which is\nthe reveal every existing list does."
    text  "把显示出来的行固定在窗口的某个固定比例位置，而不只是把它带入视野内——\n对应UMG的bEnableFixedLineOffset。\n\n这正是光标驱动菜单想要的：高亮的行留在原地，列表在它下面移动，\n而不是让行滑到它进来的那个边缘。默认关闭，这也是现有每个列表\n都在用的显示方式。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bEnableRightClickScrolling {
