DreamListViewBase:bEnableScrollAnimation {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bEnableScrollAnimation
    src   "Whether the reveal and the wheel GLIDE rather than jump -- UMG's bEnableScrollAnimation.\n\nThe reveal is ScrollIndexIntoView, NavigateToIndex and ScrollItemIntoView asked to animate; a\nnavigation press between rows still jumps, because the row it lands on has to exist at once.\n\nOff by default: every existing list's reveal lands in one frame, and a project that has tuned\nits own timing around that should keep it."
    text  "显示与滚轮是平滑滑动还是直接跳转——对应UMG的bEnableScrollAnimation。\n\n这里的显示指的是要求带动画的ScrollIndexIntoView、NavigateToIndex和ScrollItemIntoView；\n行与行之间的导航按键仍然直接跳转，因为它落到的那一行必须立刻存在。\n\n默认关闭：现有每个列表的显示都在一帧内到位，已经围绕这一点调整过\n自己时序的项目应当保持关闭。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bEnableShadowBrush {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bEnableShadowBrush
    src   "Draw a fade at each end of the window while there is more list out there -- UMG's\nbEnableShadowBrush.\n\nTwo overlays inside the viewport, each awake only while the list is scrolled away from that\nend, so the fade says \"there is more this way\" rather than being permanent decoration. Off by\ndefault; nothing existing gains an overlay it did not have."
    text  "当列表在该端之外还有内容时，在窗口两端绘制渐隐——对应UMG的\nbEnableShadowBrush，即阴影笔刷。\n\n视口内有两个叠加层，各自只在列表滚离该端时才生效，因此渐隐表达的是\n“这边还有更多”，而不是常驻的装饰。默认关闭；现有内容不会多出\n它原本没有的叠加层。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bEnableTouchAnimatedScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bEnableTouchAnimatedScrolling
    src   "Whether a TOUCH drag glides too -- UMG's bInEnableTouchAnimatedScrolling."
    text  "触摸拖拽是否也平滑滑动——对应UMG的bInEnableTouchAnimatedScrolling。"
