DreamListViewBase:bIsPointerScrollingEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bIsPointerScrollingEnabled
    src   "Whether a POINTER can scroll this list at all -- UMG's bIsPointerScrollingEnabled.\n\nThe wheel and the mouse drag together, because they are one gesture set: a list that answers\nthe wheel but not the drag is a list whose scroll bar is the only way down."
    text  "指针到底能否滚动这个列表——对应UMG的bIsPointerScrollingEnabled。\n\n滚轮和鼠标拖拽是一体的，因为它们属于同一套手势：只响应滚轮而不响应拖拽的列表，\n就是只能靠滚动条往下走的列表。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bReturnFocusToSelection {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bReturnFocusToSelection
    src   "Whether focus arriving at the LIST is handed on to the selected row -- UMG's\nbReturnFocusToSelection.\n\nWhat a player coming back from a submenu expects: focus lands where they left it rather than\nat the top. Off by default, because a list whose focus jumped somewhere else on arrival would\nchange where an existing screen's next directional press goes."
    text  "焦点到达列表时是否转交给选中的行——对应UMG的\nbReturnFocusToSelection。\n\n这正是玩家从子菜单返回时所期望的：焦点落在他们离开的地方，而不是\n回到顶部。默认关闭，因为若焦点到达时跳到别处，就会改变现有界面\n下一次方向按键的去向。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bSelectItemOnNavigation {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bSelectItemOnNavigation
    src   "Whether landing on a row by navigation also SELECTS it -- UMG's bSelectItemOnNavigation.\n\nTrue by default, on both roads: a navigation press that steps to another row selects it, as\nSListView's NavigationSelect does, and NavigateToIndex selects the index it reveals. Off, both\nonly move focus and reveal, and the selection stays wherever the player last put it -- a\nshopping list you scroll through without losing the line you were on. SelectionMode None never\nselects either way, and a press in Multi mode replaces the selection with the row it lands on,\nwhich is what SListView does for a press without modifier keys; with Shift or Ctrl held it extends\nthe selection instead (see MULTI SELECTION above)."
    text  "通过导航落到某一行时是否也选中它——对应UMG的bSelectItemOnNavigation。\n\n两条路径默认都为真：步进到另一行的导航按键会选中该行，如同\nSListView的NavigationSelect；NavigateToIndex也会选中它显示出来的索引。关闭后，\n两者都只移动焦点并显示，选中项仍停留在玩家最后一次放置的位置——\n就像浏览购物清单时不会丢掉你正看的那一行。SelectionMode为None时两种情况下\n都不会选中，而在Multi模式下按键会用落到的那一行替换选中项，\n这正是SListView在没有修饰键时按键的行为；按住Shift或Ctrl则会改为扩展\n选中范围（见上文的MULTI SELECTION）。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bShowScrollBar {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bShowScrollBar
    src   "Off means no bar at all, and the viewport keeps the gutter it would have cost."
    text  "关闭表示完全不显示滚动条，视口则保留原本要留给它的那条空边。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:bVirtualizing {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:bVirtualizing
    src   "Set while the pool is a window onto the source rather than a widget per item."
    text  "当池是源数据的窗口、而不是为每个项创建一个控件时设置。"
