DreamListViewBase:CancelListViewDragDrop {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:CancelListViewDragDrop
    src   "End a drag from this list with no drop -- UMG's CancelListViewDragDrop.\n\nGoes through the drag-drop subsystem rather than just clearing the flags: the operation, the\nvisual and the pointer's state are the subsystem's, and a list that only forgot its own half\nwould leave a visual on screen with nothing to end it."
    text  "结束此列表的拖拽而不放置——UMG的CancelListViewDragDrop。\n\n经由拖放子系统处理，而不只是清除标志：操作、可视对象和指针的状态\n都归子系统所有，若列表只清掉自己那一半，屏幕上就会留下一个\n无法结束的可视对象。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ClearListItems {
