    src   "The operation class a row's drag builds -- UMG's DragDropOperationClass.\n\nUDreamDragDropOperation by default, which already carries a payload, a tag and a visual class.\nA project with its own subclass names it here and gets it on every row."
    text  "行的拖拽所构建的操作类——UMG的DragDropOperationClass。\n\n默认为UDreamDragDropOperation，它已带有载荷、标签和可视类。\n若项目有自己的子类，可在此指定，每一行都会用它。"
