}

DreamListViewBase:DragDropVisualEntryClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:DragDropVisualEntryClass
    src   "What to show under the cursor while dragging -- UMG's DragDropVisualEntryClass.\n\nNull falls back to RowTemplateClass, which is the answer that needs no authoring: the thing\nunder the cursor should look like the row it came from, and the list already knows how to make\none of those."
    text  "拖拽时在光标下显示的内容——UMG的DragDropVisualEntryClass。\n\n为空时回退到RowTemplateClass，这是无需额外制作的答案：光标下的东西\n应当看起来像它来自的那一行，\n而列表已经知道如何创建一个。"
