    src   "Where in the window that row is pinned, 0 = the near edge, 1 = the far one. Half is the middle."
    text  "该行固定在窗口中的位置，0 = 近端边缘，1 = 远端边缘。一半即正中。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:FocusSelectedRow {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:FocusSelectedRow
    src   "Put keyboard focus on the selected row's widget, if it has one on screen.\n\nFalse when there is no selection or its row is not realized -- which is not a failure, only\nthe honest answer: a recycled list genuinely has no widget standing for an off-screen item."
    text  "将键盘焦点放到选中行的控件上（如果它已在屏幕上）。\n\n当没有选中项或选中行尚未实例化时返回false——这并非失败，而只是\n如实的回答：回收复用的列表确实没有代表屏幕外项的控件。"
    state machine
}

