DreamListViewBase:ItemObjects {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ItemObjects
    src   "The rows, as objects. Non-empty, this decides the row count and each row's item; the label\nthen comes from the matching entry of Items, or from the object's name when there is none.\nThis is the seat UUIListView's own Items array occupies, kept so a consumer that already\nmodels its rows as UObjects does not have to unpack them into text first."
    text  "行数据，以对象形式表示。非空时，它决定行数以及每一行的项；标签\n则来自 Items 中匹配的条目，没有匹配条目时使用对象的名称。\n这个位置由 UUIListView 自身的 Items 数组占据，保留它是为了让已经把\n行建模为 UObject 的使用方不必先把它们解包成文本。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:Items {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:Items
    src   "The rows, as text. The common case, and the control's job is to be the common case -- the same\ncall UDreamDropdown's Options make. Parallel to ItemObjects when both are given: the object\ncarries the data, this carries what the built-in row says."
    text  "行数据，以文本形式表示。这是最常见的情形，而该控件的职责就是服务最常见的情形——与\nUDreamDropdown 的 Options 采用相同的调用。两者都给定时与 ItemObjects 平行：对象\n承载数据，此项承载内置行所显示的内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:NavigateToIndex {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:NavigateToIndex
    src   "Select an item's row AND bring it into view -- UMG's NavigateToIndex.\n\nThe two halves in one call because doing them separately is always wrong in the same way: a\nselection that is off screen is a selection nobody can see they made. With\nbSelectItemOnNavigation off, or SelectionMode None, it only reveals. A navigation press moving\nbetween rows makes the same two moves (see UDreamListRowButton), through SetItemSelection."
    text  "选中某个项的行并将其滚动到可见区域——即 UMG 的 NavigateToIndex。\n\n把这两半放在一次调用中，是因为分开做总会以同样的方式出错：一个\n在屏幕外的选中，就是没人看得见自己做出的选中。关闭\nbSelectItemOnNavigation，或 SelectionMode 为 None 时，它只负责滚动到可见。在行之间移动的导航按键\n通过 SetItemSelection 执行同样的两步（参见 UDreamListRowButton）。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnDraggingStateChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnDraggingStateChanged
    src   "This list started or stopped dragging one of its rows -- UMG's BP_OnListViewDraggingStateChanged."
    text  "此列表开始或停止拖动其中一行——即 UMG 的 BP_OnListViewDraggingStateChanged。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnIsItemSelectableOrNavigable {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnIsItemSelectableOrNavigable
    src   "Whether one item may be chosen or navigated to -- UMG's BP_OnIsItemSelectableOrNavigable.\n\nAsked on BOTH roads, which is the point: a row that cannot be clicked but can be navigated to\nis a dead end the player can reach. Deselecting is never vetoed, or a row that became\nunselectable while chosen could never stop being chosen."
    text  "某一项是否可被选中或导航到——即 UMG 的 BP_OnIsItemSelectableOrNavigable。\n\n两条路径上都会询问，这正是关键所在：一行不能被点击却能被导航到，\n就是玩家可以走到的死胡同。取消选中永远不会被否决，否则某个被选中期间变为\n不可选的行就永远无法取消选中。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnItemAcceptDrop {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnItemAcceptDrop
    src   "A drop landed on a row -- UMG's BP_OnItemAcceptDrop, with the zone it landed in.\n\nFired only while bAllowDragDrop is on. The list does NOT re-order itself: what a drop means is\nthe consumer's to decide, and a list that moved its own source would be guessing at an edit\nonly the data's owner can make."
    text  "一次拖放落在某一行上——即 UMG 的 BP_OnItemAcceptDrop，并带有它落入的区域。\n\n仅在 bAllowDragDrop 开启时触发。列表不会自行重新排序：拖放意味着什么\n由使用方决定，而一个自行移动其数据源的列表只是在猜测一项\n只有数据所有者才能做出的编辑。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnItemClicked {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnItemClicked
    src   "A row was clicked -- every click, whatever the selection mode did with it. Separate from\nOnSelectionChanged because a click on the already-selected row is still a click, and because a\nlist whose SelectionMode is None still wants to know.\n\nFires AFTER the selection has moved, so a handler asking GetSelectedIndex sees the answer the\nuser just gave."
    text  "某一行被点击——每一次点击，无论选择模式对它做了什么。与\nOnSelectionChanged 分开，是因为点击已选中的行仍然是一次点击，而且\nSelectionMode 为 None 的列表也仍然想知道。\n\n在选择已经移动之后触发，因此询问 GetSelectedIndex 的处理程序看到的正是\n用户刚给出的答案。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnItemDoubleClicked {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnItemDoubleClicked
    src   "Two clicks on the same row inside the event system's DoubleClickTime.\n\nThat clock and no other: the pointer input module already decides what a double click is (it is\nwhat UUITextInput's select-the-word gesture uses), and a list measuring its own would disagree\nwith the field beside it -- and would be counting click EVENTS rather than pointer presses.\nThe single click still fires first, so a row that opens on a double click also selects on the\nway there."
    text  "在事件系统的 DoubleClickTime 内对同一行的两次点击。\n\n以这个时钟为准，不采用其他：指针输入模块已经决定了什么是双击（\nUUITextInput 的选择单词手势用的就是它），而列表若自行计时就会与\n旁边的字段不一致——而且统计的会是点击事件而不是指针按下。\n单击仍会先触发，因此双击即打开的行在打开途中也会\n被选中。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnItemDragCancelled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnItemDragCancelled
    src   "A drag from this list ended with nobody accepting -- UMG's BP_OnItemDragCancelled."
    text  "从此列表开始的拖动以无人接受而结束——即 UMG 的 BP_OnItemDragCancelled。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnItemDragDetected {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnItemDragDetected
    src   "A row was picked up -- UMG's BP_OnItemDragDetected. The operation is still editable here."
    text  "某一行被拾起——即 UMG 的 BP_OnItemDragDetected。此时该操作仍可编辑。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnItemDragEnter {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnItemDragEnter
    src   "A drag entered a row -- UMG's BP_OnItemDragEnter. Any drag, not only this list's own."
    text  "一行上有拖拽进入——UMG 的 BP_OnItemDragEnter。任何拖拽都算，不限于此列表自身的拖拽。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnItemIsHoveredChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnItemIsHoveredChanged
    src   "The pointer entered or left a row -- UMG's OnItemIsHoveredChanged.\n\nThe item index and its object, with the hovered flag; a row that is re-bound while the pointer\nsits over it announces the new item, because what is hovered is the ITEM and not the widget."
    text  "指针进入或离开某一行——UMG 的 OnItemIsHoveredChanged。\n\n条目索引及其对象，附带悬停标志；指针停留在某行上时该行被重新绑定，\n会通告新的条目，因为悬停的是条目本身，而不是控件。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnItemScrolledIntoView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnItemScrolledIntoView
    src   "An item came into the realized window -- UMG's BP_OnItemScrolledIntoView.\n\nThe EDGE, not the state: only items that were not realized a moment ago are announced, so a\nconsumer loading a thumbnail per row is called once per arrival rather than once per scroll."
    text  "有条目进入已实现窗口——UMG 的 BP_OnItemScrolledIntoView。\n\n是边沿，而不是状态：只通告片刻之前尚未实现的条目，因此按行加载缩略图的使用者\n每次到达只被调用一次，而不是每次滚动调用一次。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnListViewFinishedScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnListViewFinishedScrolling
    src   "The list stopped moving -- UMG's OnListViewFinishedScrolling.\n\nFired the first time a move lands with no momentum left, so a consumer loading thumbnails for\nwhat is now on screen gets one call per gesture rather than one per frame of a flick."
    text  "列表停止移动——UMG 的 OnListViewFinishedScrolling。\n\n在一次移动已无剩余动量而落定时首次触发，因此为当前屏幕上内容加载缩略图的使用者\n每次手势只收到一次调用，而不是轻扫的每一帧一次。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnListViewScrolled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnListViewScrolled
    src   "The list moved -- UMG's OnListViewScrolled. Carries the offset and the visible fraction, which\nis what a consumer drawing its own position indicator needs and cannot work out alone."
    text  "列表发生了移动——UMG 的 OnListViewScrolled。携带偏移量和可见比例，\n这正是自行绘制位置指示器的使用者所需要、且无法独自算出的数据。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnListViewTouchStart {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnListViewTouchStart
    src   "A touch drag began on the rows -- UMG's BP_OnListViewTouchStart. Offset and visible fraction."
    text  "行上开始了触摸拖拽——UMG 的 BP_OnListViewTouchStart。偏移量和可见比例。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnRowGenerated {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnRowGenerated
    src   "One per row, every time it is BOUND to an item -- which, while recycling, is every time that\nrow comes back round to a new item rather than once in its life, and on every row the list\nre-pushes (a rebuild, a style push, a resize), because that re-writes the row's look. A scroll\nthat leaves a row on its item binds nothing. Always after an OnRowReleased for whatever the row\nstood for before, so the two pair up. The hook for a consumer whose rows are richer than a label\nbut who would rather not author a whole class: everything under the row is reachable from here\nby display name."
    text  "每行一次，每次该行被绑定到某个条目时都会触发——在回收复用时，就是该行\n轮到新条目的每一次，而不是它一生只有一次；列表重新推送的每一行\n（重建、样式推送、调整大小）也会触发，因为那会重写该行的外观。滚动\n后若某行仍停留在其条目上，则不绑定任何东西。总是在针对该行先前所代表对象的\nOnRowReleased 之后触发，两者因此成对。对于行内容比一个标签更丰富、\n但又不愿编写整个类的使用者来说，这就是合适的钩子：行下方的所有内容都可以从这里\n按显示名称访问。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnRowInitialized {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnRowInitialized
    src   "A row widget was just created -- UMG's OnEntryInitialized, and ONCE in that widget's life.\n\nDistinct from OnRowGenerated, which fires on every bind: this is where something permanent\nbelongs, and subscribing to it from the generated hook instead is how a recycled row ends up\ncarrying one subscription per item it has ever shown."
    text  "行控件刚刚创建——UMG 的 OnEntryInitialized，且在该控件的一生中只触发一次。\n\n与每次绑定都会触发的 OnRowGenerated 不同：永久性的东西应当放在这里，\n若改为在生成钩子中订阅，被回收的行就会为它曾显示过的每个条目各带\n一个订阅。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnRowReleased {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnRowReleased
    src   "The counterpart of OnRowGenerated: a pool row is about to stop standing for this item, because\nit is re-bound -- to another item, or to this one again by a re-push -- parked, or destroyed.\nCarries the item the row was bound to, object included, even when the source has moved since.\nUMG's OnEntryReleased, and the hook for undoing whatever OnRowGenerated did to that row."
    text  "OnRowGenerated 的对应项：池中的行即将不再代表此条目，因为它被重新绑定——\n绑定到另一个条目，或因重新推送而再次绑定到这一个——被停放，或被销毁。\n携带该行原先绑定到的条目（含其对象），即使此后源已发生变化。\n即 UMG 的 OnEntryReleased，也是撤销 OnRowGenerated 对该行所做一切的钩子。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnRowsGenerated {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnRowsGenerated
    src   "A whole rebuild finished -- UMG's BP_OnEntriesGenerated.\n\nBroadcast before RebuildRows returns, which IS the batch boundary here: this control rebuilds\nsynchronously, so there is no pending request for a later frame to complete."
    text  "整个重建已完成——UMG 的 BP_OnEntriesGenerated。\n\n在 RebuildRows 返回之前广播，而这里正是批次边界：此控件同步重建，\n因此不存在留给后续帧完成的待处理请求。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnSelectionChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnSelectionChanged
    src   "Re-broadcast from the rows, so a consumer binds to the control, not to a part of it.\n\nAlso said when an edit to the SOURCE takes selected items away -- a RemoveItem, a replaced\nsource, ClearListItems -- once per edit (a batch is one edit), with whatever is left selected,\nthe way SListView::UpdateSelectionSet signals ESelectInfo::Direct. A selection that merely moved\nto a new index along with its item has not changed, and is not announced."
    text  "由各行重新广播，因此使用者绑定的是控件，而不是它的某个部分。\n\n当对源的编辑带走所选项时也会发出——RemoveItem、替换\n源、ClearListItems——每次编辑一次（一个批次算一次编辑），并带上仍然选中的内容，\n方式与 SListView::UpdateSelectionSet 发出 ESelectInfo::Direct 时相同。仅仅是随其条目一起移到\n新索引的选择并未改变，不会通告。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:OnValueChangedBP {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:OnValueChangedBP
    src   "The `<->` convention: two-way bindings synthesize their reverse route against this exact name,\nso a value control carries it alongside its spoken events. Fires with them."
    text  "`<->` 约定：双向绑定会针对这个确切的名称合成其反向路由，\n因此值控件会将它和自身对外通告的事件一并提供。与之同时触发。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:Orientation {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:Orientation
    src   "Which way the rows run -- UMG's Orientation, and the axis this whole control is written in.\n\nVertical is a column of rows that scrolls up and down; Horizontal is a band of rows that\nscrolls left and right. Every other measurement follows it: RowHeight becomes the row's extent\nALONG the scroll axis, RowSpacing the gap between two of them, and the row stretches across the\nother axis instead of down it. The scroll bar moves to the bottom edge, and the wheel, the\nreveal and the first/last calls all change axis with it.\n\nVertical is the default, which is what every existing list already is."
    text  "行的排列方向——即 UMG 的 Orientation，也是整个控件所依据的轴向。\n\nVertical 是上下滚动的行组成的列；Horizontal 是左右滚动的行\n组成的带。其他所有度量都随之变化：RowHeight 变成行沿滚动轴的尺寸，\nRowSpacing 是两行之间的间距，行则横跨另一条轴而不是沿其延伸。\n滚动条移到下边缘，滚轮、滚动显现以及 first/last 调用也都随之\n切换轴向。\n\n默认是 Vertical，现有的每个列表本来就是这个方向。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:PoolRowTemplateClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:PoolRowTemplateClass
    src   "The authored row class the pool was built with. A rebind can carry a new style into an existing\nrow but not a new CLASS -- the instance lives inside the row and is made once per pool row --\nso this is one of the two things that still forces a teardown. See RebuildRows for why a\nteardown is worth avoiding at all."
    text  "池构建时所使用的、编辑中指定的行类。重新绑定可以把新样式带入已有的\n行，但无法带入新的 CLASS——实例位于行内部，每个池行只创建一次——\n所以这是仍然会强制拆除的两件事之一。关于为什么应尽量避免拆除，请参阅\nRebuildRows。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:RebuildRows {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:RebuildRows
    src   "Throw the rows away and build them again from the source. Called for you by ApplyStyle -- row\ngeometry and row colour are both style, so there is no such thing as re-styling without it --\nand by every setter that moves the source."
    text  "丢弃这些行，并依据源重新构建。ApplyStyle 会自动调用——行\n几何和行颜色都属于样式，因此不存在不重建的重新设置样式——\n此外每个改动源的 setter 也会调用。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:RemoveItem {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:RemoveItem
    src   "Drop one object from the source and rebuild -- UMG's RemoveItem.\n\nThe matching text, if there is one, goes with it: the two arrays are parallel, and a removal\nthat shortened only one of them would re-label every row after it. Removing a selected item\ndeselects it and says so once on OnSelectionChanged, as UMG's next refresh does."
    text  "从源中移除一个对象并重建——即 UMG 的 RemoveItem。\n\n如果有对应的文本，它会一并移除：两个数组是平行的，只缩短其中一个的移除\n会让其后的每一行错位重标。移除选中项会取消其选中状态，\n并在 OnSelectionChanged 上通知一次，与 UMG 的下一次刷新一致。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:RemoveItemAt {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:RemoveItemAt
    src   "Drop the item at a source index and rebuild. Out of range does nothing."
    text  "移除源中指定索引处的项并重建。索引超出范围时不做任何事。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:RemoveItems {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:RemoveItems
    src   "Drop several objects and rebuild once -- UMG's RemoveItems."
    text  "移除多个对象并只重建一次——即 UMG 的 RemoveItems。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ResolveDropZone {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ResolveDropZone
    src   "Which zone a point falls in, as a fraction ALONG the row's main axis.\n\nStatic and pure, because it is the one piece of this that is worth pinning exactly: the first\nand last EdgeFraction of the row are the seams and everything between is the row itself. A\nquarter each end by default, which leaves the middle half -- wide enough to hit on a phone,\nnarrow enough that a re-order does not need precision."
    text  "某个点落在哪个区域，以沿行主轴的比例表示。\n\n是静态且纯的函数，因为这是其中最值得精确固定的部分：行的第一个\n和最后一个 EdgeFraction 是接缝，两者之间全部是行本身。默认\n两端各占四分之一，留下中间的一半——宽到在手机上也能点中，\n窄到重新排序时无需精确操作。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:RowLabelNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:RowLabelNode
    src   "The template's label. Every row has a copy of it, found by display name."
    text  "模板的标签。每一行都有一份副本，按显示名称查找。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:RowNodes {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:RowNodes
    src   "The row widgets that exist, in pool order -- which is visual order only while the list is not\nrecycling. RowSourceIndices says what each one is currently showing."
    text  "现有的行控件，按池顺序排列——只有在列表未进行\n回收时，这个顺序才是视觉顺序。RowSourceIndices 说明每个行当前显示的内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:RowSourceIndices {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:RowSourceIndices
    src   "Parallel to RowNodes: which source item each pool row stands for, or -1 while it is parked."
    text  "与 RowNodes 平行：每个池行代表哪个源项，处于停用状态时为 -1。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:RowTemplateClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:RowTemplateClass
    src   "A row's CONTENT, authored elsewhere: one instance of this class is created inside every row\nwidget, filling it, and the built-in label steps aside. The row's face, height, hover and\nselection stay the control's, so a template only has to draw an item.\n\nCreated once per POOL row rather than per item, which is what makes it survive recycling:\nOnRowGenerated fires on every bind, and that is where a consumer updates it.\n\nNull (the default) is the built-in label row. Instancing a user widget needs a world, so with\nnone this quietly stays the built-in row rather than producing half a list."
    text  "行的 CONTENT，在别处编写：每个行控件内部都会创建该类的一个实例来填充它，\n内置标签则让位。行的外观、高度、悬停和\n选中仍归控件所有，因此模板只需绘制一个项。\n\n按池行而不是按项创建，这正是它能经受回收的原因：\nOnRowGenerated 在每次绑定时触发，使用者在那里更新它。\n\nNull（默认值）表示内置的标签行。实例化用户控件需要 world，没有 world 时\n会静默保留内置行，而不会生成一个不完整的列表。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:RowTemplateNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:RowTemplateNode
    src   "The thing rows are copied from -- authored once, inactive, never drawn itself. Public because\nit is half of the \"hand it a template\" story: anything added under this node before the first\nrebuild rides into every row."
    text  "行的复制来源——只编写一次，处于非活动状态，自身从不绘制。公开是因为\n它是“交给它一个模板”这套做法的一半：在首次重建之前添加到该节点下的任何内容\n都会随之进入每一行。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ScrollBarNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ScrollBarNode
    src   "A real Native.ScrollBar, so the handle geometry the anchor rule dictates exists once."
    text  "一个真正的 Native.ScrollBar，因此锚点规则所规定的滑块几何只存在一份。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ScrollBarVisibility {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ScrollBarVisibility
    src   "Whether the bar stays put or disappears while every row already fits. Hidden never draws it, though the\nlist still scrolls, and keeps its gutter while the rows overflow, as a Hidden Slate bar keeps its slot."
    text  "在所有行都已容纳得下时，滚动条是保持原位还是消失。Hidden 从不绘制它，但\n列表仍可滚动，并在行溢出时保留其边距，就像 Hidden 的 Slate 滚动条保留自己的位置一样。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ScrollIndexIntoView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ScrollIndexIntoView
    src   "Bring an item's row into view without touching the selection -- UMG's ScrollIndexIntoView."
    text  "将某项的行带入视野，但不改变选择——即 UMG 的 ScrollIndexIntoView。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ScrollingAnimationInterpolationSpeed {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ScrollingAnimationInterpolationSpeed
    src   "How fast that glide closes the distance -- UMG's ScrollingAnimationInterpolationSpeed, and its\nparameterisation: a SPEED, where the scroll behaviour's own tween takes a duration.\n\nTurned into a duration at the push, because the two describe the same ease and the behaviour\nonly knows one of them: a higher speed is a shorter glide."
    text  "该滑行收敛距离的快慢——即 UMG 的 ScrollingAnimationInterpolationSpeed，以及它的\n参数化方式：它表示的是速度，而滚动行为自身的补间接受的是时长。\n\n在推入时转换为时长，因为两者描述的是同一种缓动，而该行为\n只认识其中一种：速度越高，滑行越短。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ScrollIntoViewDestination {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ScrollIntoViewDestination
    src   "Where a row revealed by ScrollIndexIntoView or by navigation ends up -- UMG calls this\nScrollIntoViewAlignment and spells it as a float; this is the four-answer enum the scroll box\nand the scroll behaviour already share, because they are the same question."
    text  "由 ScrollIndexIntoView 或导航揭示出来的行最终停在何处——UMG 将此称为\nScrollIntoViewAlignment（对齐），并以浮点数表示；这里是滚动框\n和滚动行为已经共用的四选一枚举，因为它们问的是同一个问题。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ScrollItemIntoView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ScrollItemIntoView
    src   "Scroll the least distance that brings an item's row fully into the viewport.\n\nComputed from the row pitch rather than from a widget, so it answers for an item whose row is\nnot realized -- which is the only version of this that means anything while recycling.\n\nGlides there, with the wheel's ease and duration, when bInAnimate AND bEnableScrollAnimation are\nboth on; jumps otherwise. A navigation press always jumps: the row it lands on has to exist the\nmoment the press names it."
    text  "以最小距离滚动，使某项的行完整进入视口。\n\n按行间距而非按控件计算，因此对行尚未实化的项也能\n给出结果——在回收复用时，也只有这种版本才有意义。\n\n当 bInAnimate 与 bEnableScrollAnimation 同时开启时，以滚轮的缓动和\n时长滑行到该处；否则直接跳转。导航按键始终直接跳转：按键指定某行的那一刻，\n该行就必须存在。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ScrollToBottom {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ScrollToBottom
    src   "Jump to the last row -- UMG's ScrollToBottom."
    text  "跳转到最后一行——即 UMG 的 ScrollToBottom。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ScrollToTop {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ScrollToTop
    src   "Jump to the first row -- UMG's ScrollToTop."
    text  "跳转到第一行——即 UMG 的 ScrollToTop。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SelectedIndex {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SelectedIndex
    src   "The selected row, as an index into the SOURCE -- not into the rows on screen. For a list the\ntwo are the same; for a tree they are not, and an index that survives a collapse is the one\nworth handing to a binding. -1 is none.\n\nWith SelectionMode at Multi this is the ANCHOR -- the row the last selection landed on -- and\nSelectedIndices is the whole answer. (A Shift range is measured from a range anchor of its own,\nSListView's, which a range leaves where it was: see MULTI SELECTION above.) The two are kept in\nstep: writing this one (a .dui line, a details-panel edit, a `<->` binding) is read as \"that row\nis selected\", and a set that empties puts this back to -1."
    text  "选中的行，以 SOURCE 中的索引表示——而不是屏幕上的行索引。对于列表，两者相同；\n对于树则不同，而一个能在折叠后仍然存续的索引，才值得交给绑定。\n-1 表示无。\n\n当 SelectionMode 为 Multi 时，这是 ANCHOR——最后一次选择落到的行——\n而 SelectedIndices 才是完整答案。（Shift 范围由它自己的范围锚点度量，\n即 SListView 的锚点，范围操作后该锚点会留在原处：见上文的 MULTI SELECTION。）\n两者保持同步：写入此项（.dui 中的一行、详情面板中的编辑、`<->` 绑定）会被读作\n“该行已被选中”，而清空集合会把它恢复为 -1。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SelectedIndices {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SelectedIndices
    src   "Every selected row, as source indices, in the order they were chosen. Authorable, but the\nordinary road is SetItemSelection / SetSelectedIndex -- those keep SelectedIndex in step and\nrepaint.\n\nBlueprintReadWrite through a setter rather than read-only: a raw write used to be picked up\nonly on the next rebuild, which left the anchor pointing at a row that was no longer selected\nand the rows painted for a selection that had moved. SetSelectedIndices settles both."
    text  "所有选中的行，以源索引表示，按选择顺序排列。可直接编写，但通常的途径是\nSetItemSelection / SetSelectedIndex——它们会让 SelectedIndex 保持同步并\n重绘。\n\n通过 setter 实现的蓝图读写（BlueprintReadWrite），而不是只读：原始写入\n过去只在下一次重建时才被读取，这会让锚点仍指向一个已不再选中的行，而行仍按已经移动的选择来绘制。\nSetSelectedIndices 会同时处理这两者。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SelectionMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SelectionMode
    src   "How many rows can be selected at once, in UUIListView's four modes -- the same enum, because\nthey are the same four answers and a second one spelling them again is a second thing to keep\ntrue. None ignores clicks; Single always leaves exactly one chosen; SingleToggle lets a second\nclick on the chosen row clear it; Multi chooses as SListView does -- a plain click one row, Ctrl\na row more or less, Shift a range, a finger tap a row more (see MULTI SELECTION above)."
    text  "一次能选中多少行，取决于 UUIListView 的四种模式——用的是同一个枚举，因为\n它们就是同样的四个答案，再写一个枚举来重复表述，就等于多了一件必须保持一致的事。\nNone 忽略点击；Single 始终只留下恰好一个选中项；SingleToggle 允许再次点击已选中的行将其清除；\nMulti 的选择方式与 SListView 相同——普通点击选中一行，Ctrl 点击增加或减少一行，\nShift 点击选择一段范围，手指轻点增加一行（见上文的 MULTI SELECTION）。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetAlternatingRowColors {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetAlternatingRowColors
    src   "The five knobs below are read only by the style push or the row build, so each setter writes\nthe field and then makes that push itself -- which is the whole of what a BlueprintSetter buys\nhere. Restyling never creates or destroys a row (see the list's restyle-identity test), so the\nfirst three are cheap; the two virtualization knobs change how many rows there ARE, and go\nthrough RebuildRows for that reason."
    text  "下面五个开关只由样式推入或行构建读取，因此每个 setter 都会写入字段，\n然后自己执行那次推入——这就是蓝图 setter（BlueprintSetter）在这里的全部意义。\n重新设置样式从不会创建或销毁行（见列表的 restyle-identity 测试），所以\n前三个开销很小；两个虚拟化开关会改变实际存在的行数，因此\n要经由 RebuildRows 处理。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetDragDropVisualPivot {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetDragDropVisualPivot
    src   "The five below are read when a drag STARTS, so setting one is all a setter has to do; a drag\nalready in flight keeps the visual and the operation it began with."
    text  "下面五项在拖拽开始时读取，因此设置器只需写入该项即可；\n已经在进行的拖拽会保留其开始时的视觉效果和操作。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetDragEdgeScrollBandSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetDragEdgeScrollBandSize
    src   "Clamped at zero. Read on every step, so a change reaches a drag already in flight."
    text  "限制为零。每一步都会读取，因此更改会作用于已经在进行的拖拽。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetDragEdgeScrollSpeed {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetDragEdgeScrollSpeed
    src   "Clamped at zero. Read on every step, like the band."
    text  "限制为零。与边缘滚动带一样，每一步都会读取。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetEnableDragEdgeScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetEnableDragEdgeScrolling
    src   "Turning it off mid-drag stops a scroll already under way, and says it finished."
    text  "在拖拽过程中关闭它会停止已经开始的滚动，并报告滚动已完成。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetFingerDrag {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetFingerDrag
    src   "Read when a finger's drag starts: a drag already under way goes on as it began."
    text  "在手指拖拽开始时读取：已经开始的拖拽会按开始时的状态继续。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetItemObjects {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetItemObjects
    src   "Replace the object source and rebuild.\n\nThe selection follows its OBJECTS to wherever they landed, silently -- nothing about what is\nchosen has changed. Objects that left the source leave the selection too, and that IS a change:\nit is announced once on OnSelectionChanged."
    text  "替换对象源并重建。\n\n选择会静默地跟随其对象到它们最终所在的位置——所选内容本身没有任何变化。\n离开源的对象也会离开选择，而这确实是一次变化：\n它会在 OnSelectionChanged 上通知一次。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetItems {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetItems
    src   "Replace the text source and rebuild.\n\nA text-only source has no identity to carry a selection across, so a selection it held is\ndropped -- and, like any source edit that takes selected items away, announced once on\nOnSelectionChanged."
    text  "替换文本源并重建。\n\n纯文本源没有可用于携带选择跨越源的身份标识，因此它原先持有的选择会被丢弃——\n并且，与任何会移除已选项目的源编辑一样，\n会在 OnSelectionChanged 上通知一次。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetItemSelection {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetItemSelection
    src   "Add or remove ONE row from the selection, which is the only call that can express a multi\nselection. bInClearOthers is implied by every mode except Multi.\n\nFires both selection events whenever the selection actually moved -- including the case where\nTHIS row's state did not change but others were cleared, which is where the behaviour-side\nversion left rows painted as selected after they had been dropped."
    text  "向选择中添加或移除一行，这是唯一能表达多选的调用。\n除 Multi 外，所有模式都会隐含 bInClearOthers。\n\n每当选择实际发生变化时，都会触发两个选择事件——包括这一行的状态未变但其他行被清除的情况；\n在行为侧版本中，正是这种情况导致行在被取消选择后\n仍被绘制为选中状态。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetOrientation {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetOrientation
    src   "Turn the whole control through ninety degrees.\n\nVirtual so a subclass can refuse: a tree is a column by definition, and a horizontal one is not\na thing UMG has either."
    text  "将整个控件旋转九十度。\n\n虚函数，因此子类可以拒绝：树按定义就是列，而水平树也不是\nUMG 所具备的东西。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetRowTemplateClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetRowTemplateClass
    src   "Replace the class every row's content is made from.\n\nA teardown, not a restyle: the instance lives INSIDE each pool row and is made once per row, so\na rebind can carry a new style into an existing row but never a new class."
    text  "替换用于生成每一行内容的类。\n\n这是一次拆除重建，而不是重新设置样式：实例位于每个池行内部，并且每行只创建一次，\n因此重新绑定可以将新样式带入现有行，但绝不能带入新类。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetScrollOffset {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetScrollOffset
    src   "Put the viewport at an offset down the column, in local units. Clamped by the scroll range."
    text  "将视口沿列向下放到指定的偏移处，单位为本地单位。受滚动范围限制。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetSelectedIndex {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetSelectedIndex
    src   "Moves the highlight and fires both selection events. Out of range selects nothing.\n\nSelects exactly ONE row whatever the mode but None, which selects nothing at all -- this is the\nsingle-selection road, and the name says so. SetItemSelection is the one that can add to a\nMulti selection.\n\nAn index asked for while the source is still EMPTY (or, with bAllowKeepPreselectedItems on, not\nyet long enough) is kept rather than dropped: GetSelectedIndex reads -1 until the items arrive,\nand then the row is selected and both events fire once. Any other selection made meanwhile --\na click, ClearSelection, another index -- replaces the kept one."
    text  "移动高亮并触发两个选择事件。超出范围时不会选择任何内容。\n\n除 None 外，无论何种模式都只选择一行，而 None 完全不选择——这是单选路径，\n名称也说明了这一点。\nSetItemSelection 才是那个可以向多选添加项目的调用。\n\n在源仍为空（或启用 bAllowKeepPreselectedItems 时，源尚未足够长）的情况下请求的索引会被保留而不是丢弃：\n在项目到达之前，GetSelectedIndex 会读取为 -1，随后该行被选中，并且两个事件各触发一次。\n在此期间进行的任何其他选择——一次点击、ClearSelection、另一个索引——\n都会替换被保留的索引。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetSelectedIndexWithoutNotify {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetSelectedIndexWithoutNotify
    src   "The same move, silently: for pushing an authored value in, which is not the user choosing."
    text  "同样的操作，但静默执行：用于推入外部指定的值，而不是用户在选择。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetSelectedIndices {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetSelectedIndices
    src   "Replace the whole selection at once. Keeps the anchor and the rows' paint in step with it."
    text  "一次性替换整个选择。保持锚点和各行的绘制与之同步。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetSelectionMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetSelectionMode
    src   "Which mode decides how many rows can be chosen. Re-narrows the selection when it has to, and says\nso once when that changed it -- None drops the whole selection, Multi to a single mode keeps the\nanchor -- so a two-way binding is not left holding a row nothing selects any more."
    text  "由哪种模式决定可以选择多少行。必要时会收窄选择，\n并在因此发生变化时通知一次——None 丢弃整个选择，Multi 收窄为单选模式时保留\n锚点——以免双向绑定仍持有一个已无任何选中项的行。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetShadowBrush {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetShadowBrush
    src   "The image drawn over the viewport's edges while there is more to scroll to. Pushed at once."
    text  "当仍有内容可滚动时，绘制在视口边缘上的图像。会立即推送。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:SetVirtualizationThreshold {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:SetVirtualizationThreshold
    src   "Crossing the threshold changes whether the list pools, so this rebuilds rather than restyles."
    text  "越过阈值会改变列表是否使用池化，因此这会重建，而不是仅重新设置样式。"
    state machine
