DreamListViewBase:ShadowBrush {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ShadowBrush
    src   "What that fade is drawn with -- UMG's ShadowBrushStyle.\n\nOn the CONTROL rather than in FDreamListStyle: the style struct is the list's shared look and\nis resolved against the project sheet, where a fade is a per-screen decision about one list's\nedges. Keeping it here also means a project sheet cannot switch the overlay on for every list\nat once, which is not an edit anyone would make on purpose."
    text  "该渐隐所用的绘制资源——UMG的ShadowBrushStyle（阴影笔刷样式）。\n\n放在控件上而非FDreamListStyle中：样式结构体是列表的共享外观，并\n针对项目样式表解析，而渐隐是关于单个列表边缘的逐屏幕决策。\n放在这里也意味着项目样式表无法一次性为所有列表\n开启该叠加层，而这并不是任何人会刻意做出的修改。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ShadowBrushThickness {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ShadowBrushThickness
    src   "How deep the fade reaches into the window, in local units."
    text  "渐隐向窗口内延伸的深度，以本地单位计。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:ViewportNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:ViewportNode
    src   "The window the rows slide behind, and where the scroll behaviour lives."
    text  "各行在其后方滑动的窗口，也是滚动行为的所在之处。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:VirtualizationOverscan {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:VirtualizationOverscan
    src   "Extra rows kept realized past each edge of the window, so a fast scroll never shows a gap."
    text  "在窗口各边缘之外额外保持实例化的行，使快速滚动时不会出现空隙。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:VirtualizationThreshold {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:VirtualizationThreshold
    src   "Above this many rows the list recycles a window of widgets instead of building one per item.\n\nA threshold rather than a switch because the two behaviours are each right somewhere: below\nit every index has a widget, which is what a headless test, a designer preview and a consumer\nasking \"give me the widget for item 7\" all want; above it a list of a hundred thousand is a\npool of thirty. Zero recycles always; a very large number never does."
    text  "超过此行数时，列表会回收一个控件窗口，而不是为每个项各建一个控件。\n\n这里用阈值而非开关，是因为两种行为各有其适用之处：低于阈值时\n每个索引都有对应的控件，这正是无头测试、设计器预览以及询问“给我第7项的控件”的使用方\n所需要的；高于阈值时，十万行的列表也只是一个\n三十个控件的池。零表示始终回收；一个非常大的数字表示从不回收。"
    state machine
}

DreamListViewBase:VisibleItemIndices {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#DreamListViewBase:VisibleItemIndices
    src   "The display positions of the items the source is showing, in order."
    text  "数据源当前显示的项对应的显示位置，按顺序排列。"
