EDreamItemDropZone {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#EDreamItemDropZone
    src   "Where a drop landed relative to the row under the pointer -- UMG's EItemDropZone.\n\nThree answers, not two, because \"between these rows\" and \"onto this row\" are different edits: a\nre-order wants the seam, an assignment wants the row. The names are UMG's and are written for a\nvertical list; a horizontal one reads AboveItem as \"before it\" and BelowItem as \"after it\",\nbecause the question was always about SOURCE ORDER rather than about up and down."
    text  "拖放落点相对于指针下那一行的位置——即UMG的EItemDropZone。\n\n有三种答案而非两种，因为“这些行之间”和“落到这一行上”是不同的编辑：重新\n排序要的是接缝，赋值要的是行本身。名称取自UMG，且是按\n垂直列表书写的；水平列表会把AboveItem读作“在它之前”，把BelowItem读作“在它之后”，\n因为这个问题始终关乎源顺序（SOURCE ORDER），而非上下方向。"
    state machine
}

EDreamItemDropZone.AboveItem {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#EDreamItemDropZone:AboveItem
    src   "The seam before the row: a re-order that puts the dragged item ahead of it."
    text  "行之前的接缝：重新排序会把拖动的项放在它前面。"
    state machine
}

EDreamItemDropZone.BelowItem {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#EDreamItemDropZone:BelowItem
    src   "The seam after the row."
    text  "行之后的接缝。"
    state machine
}

