EDreamListFingerDrag.ScrollList {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamListView.h#EDreamListFingerDrag:ScrollList
    src   "The list scrolls under the finger and no row is picked up, as in UMG: a touch drag on a row of an SListView is the\nlist's (STableRow hands it to its table before the row's own drag is asked). The mouse still picks rows up."
    text  "列表在手指下滚动，不拾取任何行，与UMG中一样：在SListView的行上进行触摸拖动属于\n列表的拖动（在询问行自身的拖动之前，STableRow会先把它交给其表格）。鼠标仍会拾取行。"
    state machine
}

